Clearance resume template: latex-moderncv-classic ("LaTeX ModernCV Classic")
Copyright 2026 Clearance. All rights reserved.

  Template id:      latex-moderncv-classic
  Template version: 1.0.1
  Layout:          one column, large name, one contact line, thin rule under
                   section headings, slightly larger leading
  Attribution:     Clearance

Clearance template, original implementation. Inspired by ModernCV (LPPL-1.3c),
but no upstream source is copied: the document compiled at render time is generated
per resume by backend/src/render/latexExport.ts.

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License"); you may not use
these files except in compliance with the License. A copy of the License is
published at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

THIRD-PARTY WORKS THIS TEMPLATE RENDERS WITH. They are separate works under their
own licences and NONE of them is part of this file:

  Engine  TeX Live 2022 (pdfTeX 3.141592653-2.6-1.40.24)   LPPL-1.3c
          shipped as the pinned clearance/latex-worker image, built from Debian
          bookworm's texlive-latex-base and texlive-fonts-recommended packages.
  Fonts   Computer Modern, shipped with the same TeX Live image.
  Packages  none. The generated document loads only `fontenc`, `inputenc` and
          `geometry`, all from texlive-latex-base.
